    "document_type": "regulation",
    "policy_area": "Industry",
    "article": "Article 5(1)(a)(i) - Benchmarks",
    "target_text": "Union extraction capacity is capable of extracting the ores, minerals or concentrates needed to produce at least 10 % of the Union’s annual consumption of strategic raw materials, to the extent possible in light of the Union’s reserves;",
