    "article": "Article 8(3) — Action plan on recommendations",
    "target_text": "Member States shall, if applicable, present to the Commission and the ECDC in a timely manner within nine months of the receipt of the ECDC conclusions, an action plan addressing the proposed recommendations of the assessment, together with the corresponding recommended actions and milestones.",
