    "policy_area": "Climate",
    "article": "Article 2(2) — Climate-neutrality objective",
    "target_text": "2. The relevant Union institutions and the Member States shall take the necessary measures at Union and national level, respectively, to enable the collective achievement of the climate-neutrality objective set out in paragraph 1, taking into account the importance of promoting both fairness and solidarity among Member States and cost-effectiveness in achieving this objective.",
