    "article": "Article 6(1) — flood hazard and risk maps",
    "target_text": "Member States shall, at the level of the river basin district, or unit of management referred to in Article 3(2)(b), prepare flood hazard maps and flood risk maps, at the most appropriate scale for the areas identified under Article 5(1).",
    "target_label": "other",
