    "target_text": "4. By 30 June 2024, each Member State shall submit to the Commission its intended trajectory towards the 2030 target set out in Annex IIa, expressed in terms of annual national targets. Such trajectory shall be consistent with that Member State's integrated national energy and climate plan and with the Union's greenhouse gas inventory data.",
